#   1. What city were you born in?     → Melbourne
#   2. What was the name of your first school? → Demo School
#   3. What is your favorite book?     → TeachTeam Guide
#   4. What was your childhood nickname? → Demo
#
# After schema/auth changes, refresh local data:  cd backend && npm run db:reset
# (Removes test signups and realigns user_security_answers with demo accounts.)
